        <item>
            <title>2.0.3</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
  <li>Follow each stretch with a large animated demo on the exercise break screen, easy to see from a few steps away.</li>
  <li>See how each break style, theme and Posture Coach works with new animated previews in Settings.</li>
  <li>Breather opens at login only when you turn it on in the welcome tour or Settings.</li>
  <li>Settings and the Pro offer open cleanly, with the menu bar menu closing out of the way.</li>
  <li>Choose whether to share anonymous usage data in General settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
